cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. If you use it in academic work, please also cite the accompanying methods paper (see preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "Intra-patient Heterogeneity Feature Extractor"
abstract: >-
  R implementation of a framework for quantifying intra-patient heterogeneity
  from lesion-level PET uptake values (SUVmax or SUVmean), across eight
  conceptual feature groups: central tendency, spread, distributional shape,
  entropy/energy, statistical inequality, and distance-weighted ecological
  diversity.
